// Ice Cream Man's tunables: every number a run reads (tuning.rs), with the
// same names, defaults and bounds as ~/work/aethyr-demo/src/icecream/rules.h
// (ICECREAM_TUNABLES), in the same order. verse/icecream/rules.coax loads it.

